    "detailed_description": "<h1>Mirth Island Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for Mirth Island Demo, please play <strong>Mirth Melody</strong>. (Sorry we can't put the link here, please find Mirth Melody from the Steam search bar.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410360/extras/4159d55579ce1312a3288a8c942ed7cc.avif?t=1751575081\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mirth Island</strong> is a heartwarming game about <strong>resilience</strong>, <strong>personal growth</strong>, and <strong>community</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his acting career fails, Dodo returns to his hometown feeling heartbroken. Upon arrival, he learns that the beloved theater where his passion for acting first began is in ruins. Despite his struggles, Dodo chooses to help his childhood friend Rita rebuild the theater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he works on the theater, Dodo also helps the people of the island with their problems, and in doing so, he discovers that helping others brings him happiness and a sense of purpose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the cute little world of Mirth Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410360/extras/6494b7141e4744e866c18cedcb193673.poster.avif?t=1751575081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410360/extras/6494b7141e4744e866c18cedcb193673.webm?t=1751575081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2410360/extras/6494b7141e4744e866c18cedcb193673.mp4?t=1751575081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop p